/-!
Bounded data certificates for the fixed production combined-NC terminal.

Owns: the exact 6,595 generated source records at source-list positions
1,426 through 8,020, their absolute row IDs, sparse A/B/C correspondence to
the independent terminal program, and canonicality of all 6,593 definition
records.

Does not own: source-to-selective lowering, transcript scheduling, padding
truth, parent/child authority, commitment binding, costs, or row removal.

No native certificate sees the joined terminal interval. Row certificates
compare 110, 128, or 85 proof-free `RawSourceRow`/`Row` pairs. Canonicality
certificates inspect 110, 128, or 83 proof-free `Definition` records.
The final-boundary certificate projects exactly 85 source-row numbers. Thus
the maximum certificate cardinality is 128 records.

Assurance tier: artifact-checked for this fixed generated profile once this
module and its semantic parent validate.
-/

